Revision history for Perl extension List-Flatten-XS

0.06 2026-09-14T07:27:10Z

    - Extend the XS return stack before returning a flattened list, fixing
      "failed to extend arg stack" on DEBUGGING perls (GH #3).
    - Add regression coverage for large lists and empty return values.
    - Declare Module::Build::XSUtil as a configure prerequisite.

0.05 2018-01-21T09:17:41Z

    - Added function to throw exception using croak instead of into infinity loop when passed circular reference

0.04 2018-01-21T06:43:26Z

    - Supported to compile on thread perl

0.03 2018-01-20T14:07:42Z

    - Fixed not to flatten blessed array reference

0.02 2017-03-31T12:57:40Z

    - Removed 'static_install' option from minil.toml

0.01 2017-03-31T06:19:17Z

    - original version
